# The Swarmweaver: "When The Swarmweaver enters, create two 1/1 black and green Insect creature tokens with flying. Delirium - As
# long as there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, Insects and Spiders you control get +1/+1 and have
# deathtouch." Bot2's Grist (turn 2) makes a plain Insect of its own. On turn 1 Bot1 puts an Ornithopter into its graveyard with
# Entomb: artifact, creature and instant, three types. On turn 3 the Swarmweaver makes two Insects that are 1/1 flyers without
# deathtouch (three types is not delirium). On turn 5 a second Entomb puts a Swamp there: the fourth type, a land, and the two
# Insects are 2/2 with deathtouch while the Swarmweaver (a Scarecrow) and Bot2's Insect stay as they were.

